---
import MinimalLayout from '../layouts/MinimalLayout.astro';
---

<MinimalLayout title="Gagan P" active="About">
  <div class="space-y-5 sm:space-y-7 text-sm sm:text-base leading-[1.8] text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300">
    <p class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Hi, I'm Gagan.</p>

    <p>
      I'm 19, an AI engineer at <a href="https://rowboatlabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">Rowboat Labs</a> (YC S24),
      and I do AI research at <a href="https://eunicelabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">Eunice Labs</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      I love to build things and make stuff that are used by people. I make machines learn.
      Most of what I know about ML came from implementing papers,
      <a href="/blogs" class="link">writing about them</a>, and putting it out in public.
    </p>

    <div>
      <p class="mb-3">Some things I've done:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 list-disc pl-5 marker:text-neutral-400 dark:marker:text-neutral-600">
        <li>
          Founded <a href="https://ztutor.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">zTutor</a>,
          a personal AI video tutor. 2000+ videos generated, backed by <a href="https://www.3f.vc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">3F Venture Capital</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Wrote <a href="/research" class="link">ARIA</a>,
          a reasoning model that allocates thinking tokens by problem difficulty — 2.3&times; fewer tokens on GSM8K and MATH-500.
        </li>
        <li>
          Taught a course on neural networks and deep learning to ~50 students at
          <a href="https://pesu.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">PESU I/O</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built <a href="/projects" class="link">a dozen other things</a> —
          an AI voice tutor that draws while it talks, a second brain for researchers, an Instagram for arXiv papers.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p id="contact" class="pt-2">
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/Gagancreates" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">GitHub</a>
      and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gaganp56/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">LinkedIn</a>,
      or say hi at <a href="mailto:gagan@eunicelabs.com" class="link">gagan@eunicelabs.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</MinimalLayout>
